window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-e65d1fa4c1e19469"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"developers\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">开发者</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需查看完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 后追加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>Codex 既支持日常代码工作，也支持跨本地与云端环境的深度集成。开发者工作流程涵盖代码审查、集成终端、可重复使用的技能与插件、通过 SDK 和 App Server 实现的自动化、团队工具，以及各使用界面的参考资料。</p> <p>将 Codex 用于代码库、开发环境、自动化和团队工具。</p> <p><a id=\"whats-new-in-codex-for-engineers\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"codex\">工程师如何使用 Codex 新功能</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-47b0440a51c2fc92\">探索工作流程</a> <a id=\"development-workflows\"></a></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"_2\">开发工作流程</h2> <p>在 ChatGPT 中审查更改并使用开发工具。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-47b0440a51c2fc92\">代码审查</a> — 在发布之前审查更改并处理反馈。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3903992afce071c2\">集成终端</a> — 在 ChatGPT 桌面应用中运行命令并查看输出。 <a id=\"extend-and-automate\"></a></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"_3\">扩展与自动化</h2> <p>打包开发工作流程并运行确定性的自动化任务。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-575ba4762ea69b23\">构建技能</a> — 为 ChatGPT 和 Codex 中可重复执行的任务打包指令和资源。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0d81218eacd2463c\">构建插件</a> — 为 ChatGPT 和 Codex 打包技能及 MCP 服务器。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-d8e7ab2e8f18b498\">网站工具（WebMCP）</a> — 使用 WebMCP 让 AI 智能体可以直接与你的网站交互。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d\">注释扩展能力（Annotations Extensibility）</a> — 自定义浏览器注释中的网页选区、上下文和控件。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0aecdb1ef0cec0a4\">Hooks（钩子）</a> — 在 Codex 发出生命周期事件时运行自定义命令。 <a id=\"environments\"></a></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"_4\">环境</h2> <p>选择开发工作运行的位置及其隔离方式。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-275a09b4f8630225\">环境</a> — 比较本地、云端及其他运行任务的方式。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-86cde8be2e24d05a\">本地环境</a> — 为项目和工作树配置初始化脚本与操作。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-d955137d94c4d306\">Git 工作树</a> — 在独立工作树中隔离并行更改。</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"codex-cloud\">Codex Cloud</h2> <p>在云端运行编程任务，并使用项目工具和服务访问权限。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7ac5ae1c18e03bf1\">云端环境</a> — 创建、配置并共享可复用于云端任务的环境。 <a id=\"build-with-codex\"></a></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"codex_1\">使用 Codex 构建</h2> <p>将 Codex 集成到产品、系统和自动化工作流程中。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-e3c5173f4c4c14ef\">Codex SDK</a> — 在你的应用中以编程方式控制 Codex。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-341246db376ea9e1\">App Server</a> — 集成驱动 Codex 客户端的协议。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-30fdd98f8c3ae469\">GitHub Action</a> — 在 GitHub Actions 工作流程中运行 Codex。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-8e570f2a8916c65a\">非交互模式</a> — 从脚本和其他自动化系统运行 Codex。 <a id=\"third-party-integrations\"></a></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"_5\">第三方集成</h2> <p>在团队已经使用的工具中委派和跟踪工作。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-ba7354e174823641\">GitHub</a> — 分派工作、审查更改，并推动工作进入拉取请求阶段。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-e0c9ac1b89ddeeb2\">GitLab（Beta）</a> — 连接项目、委派工作并审查合并请求。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-345f9e63361a6444\">Slack</a> — 在 Slack 中向 ChatGPT 发起请求，并将代码仓库工作委派给 Codex Cloud。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-434ee24ee096022e\">Linear</a> — 将问题分派给 Codex，并跟进直至交付。 <a id=\"reference\"></a></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"_6\">参考资料</h2> <p>查找面向开发者使用界面的命令、设置和插件提交错误信息。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-2a01a9d34cde2424\">CLI 自定义</a> — 调整语法高亮、主题和 Shell 行为。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-820e54e1b31b71d3\">开发者命令</a> — 在桌面应用、Codex CLI 和 IDE 扩展中使用命令与斜杠命令。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7969ca0198aaf47f\">开发者设置</a> — 为开发工作配置桌面应用、Codex CLI 和 IDE 扩展。</li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"developers\">Developers</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Codex supports everyday code work and deeper integrations across local and cloud environments. Its developer workflows span code review, the integrated terminal, reusable skills and plugins, automation with the SDK and App Server, team tools, and reference material for each surface.</p> <p>Use Codex with codebases, development environments, automation, and your team's tools.</p> <h2 id=\"whats-new-in-codex-for-engineers\">What's new in Codex for engineers</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-47b0440a51c2fc92\">Explore workflows</a></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"development-workflows\">Development workflows</h2> <p>Review changes and work with development tools in ChatGPT.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-47b0440a51c2fc92\">Code review</a> — Review changes and address feedback before you ship.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3903992afce071c2\">Integrated terminal</a> — Run commands and inspect output inside the ChatGPT desktop app.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"extend-and-automate\">Extend and automate</h2> <p>Package development workflows and run deterministic automation.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-575ba4762ea69b23\">Build skills</a> — Package instructions and resources for repeatable tasks in ChatGPT and Codex.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0d81218eacd2463c\">Build plugins</a> — Package skills and MCP servers for ChatGPT and Codex.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-d8e7ab2e8f18b498\">Site tools (WebMCP)</a> — Use WebMCP to give AI agents a direct way to work with your website.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-04a85e845544535d\">Annotations Extensibility</a> — Customize website selection, context, and controls for browser annotations.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0aecdb1ef0cec0a4\">Hooks</a> — Run custom commands when Codex emits lifecycle events.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"environments\">Environments</h2> <p>Choose where development work runs and how it is isolated.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-275a09b4f8630225\">Environments</a> — Compare local, cloud, and other ways to run a task.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-86cde8be2e24d05a\">Local environments</a> — Configure setup scripts and actions for projects and worktrees.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-d955137d94c4d306\">Git worktrees</a> — Isolate parallel changes in separate working trees.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"codex-cloud\">Codex Cloud</h2> <p>Run coding tasks in the cloud with your project tools and service access.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7ac5ae1c18e03bf1\">Cloud environments</a> — Create, configure, and share reusable setups for cloud tasks.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"build-with-codex\">Build with Codex</h2> <p>Add Codex to products, systems, and automated workflows.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-e3c5173f4c4c14ef\">Codex SDK</a> — Control Codex programmatically from your application.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-341246db376ea9e1\">App Server</a> — Integrate with the protocol that powers Codex clients.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-30fdd98f8c3ae469\">GitHub Action</a> — Run Codex from GitHub Actions workflows.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-8e570f2a8916c65a\">Non-interactive mode</a> — Run Codex from scripts and other automated systems.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"third-party-integrations\">Third-party integrations</h2> <p>Delegate and track work from tools your team already uses.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-ba7354e174823641\">GitHub</a> — Assign work, review changes, and move toward a pull request.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-e0c9ac1b89ddeeb2\">GitLab (Beta)</a> — Connect projects, delegate work, and review merge requests.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-345f9e63361a6444\">Slack</a> — Start requests with ChatGPT in Slack and delegate repository work to Codex Cloud.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-434ee24ee096022e\">Linear</a> — Assign issues to Codex and follow work through delivery.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"reference\">Reference</h2> <p>Find commands, settings, and plugin submission errors for developer surfaces.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-2a01a9d34cde2424\">CLI customization</a> — Adjust syntax highlighting, themes, and shell behavior.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-820e54e1b31b71d3\">Developer commands</a> — Use commands and slash commands in the desktop app, Codex CLI, and IDE extension.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7969ca0198aaf47f\">Developer settings</a> — Configure the desktop app, Codex CLI, and IDE extension for development.</li> </ul>"};
